use binding
register web-1.0 pins 2 edition "2026-10" lease 8d use binding-app

grant
  grant call web-1.0::q to web

as web call web-1.0

as web call web-1.0 0 error UnknownQuery

as web call web-1.0 8 error UnknownQuery

as web call web-1.0 4294967295 error UnknownQuery

drop role web

as web call web-1.0 8 error UnknownQuery

query
  from a in catalog::audit.Denied where a.role == "web" select a.origin
